# Generated take-off benchmark fixtures. Each drawing.dxf is ~39,000 lines and
# they are produced by the benchmark runner, so they are regenerated rather
# than tracked. Test suites themselves are NOT ignored: a blanket *.test.*
# rule removed 175 tests and 61 e2e specs from the repository and would have
# silently swallowed every test written afterwards.
